{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09155","headline":"送常侍御却使西蕃 · 韦应物","name":"送常侍御却使西蕃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归奏圣朝行万里，却衔天诏报蕃臣。\n本是诸生守文墨，今将匹马静烟尘。\n旅宿关河逢暮雨，春耕亭障识遗民。\n此去多应收故地，宁辞沙塞往来频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}